              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.19.30"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "30",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.21.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "21:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Atyo Mefiboshesi mwene Yonasaani, mwijukuru wa Saulo yaija owa Daudi, yaajuumara omu maisho ge, yaamutangirira. Daudi yaamugira ati: Mefioshesi! Onu yaamugarukamu ati: Omwiru waawe ari aha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.19.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 19:28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Daudi yaamugira ati: Otatiina, ahabw'okuba buzimazima niinyija kukukorera eby'embabazi ahabwa Yonasaani sho, nkugarurire ebibanja bya shwenkuru byona; kandi oryaguma nooriira aha meeza yangye obutoosha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mefiboshesi yaagaruka yaamwinamira, yaagira ati: omwiru waawe ni kintu ki, iwe okuunyetaho, nyowe embwa efiire?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.9.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyima omugabe yaayeta Ziiba omuheereza wa Saulo, yaamugira ati: Ebyabaire biri ebya Saulo byona n'eby'ab'omu ka ye boona, naabiha mutabani wa mukama waawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.19.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 19:17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kandi iwe na batabani baawe n'abairu baawe mugume mumuhingire emisiri, mumureetere ebyezire, mutabani wa mukama waawe abone kutunga eby'okurya; kwonka Mefiboshesi mutabani wa mukama waawe aryaguma naariira aha meeza yangye obutoosha. Kandi Ziiba ogwo akaba aine abatabani ikumi na bataano, n'abairu makumi abiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ziiba yaagira omugabe ati: Ebi Nyakusinga omugabe yaaragiira omwiru we byona, omwiru we nikwo araagume naabitwaza. Okuruga aho Mefiboshesi yaaguma naariira aha meeza y'omugabe, nk'omwana w'omugabe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.8.34"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Bus 8:34",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kandi Mefiboshesi akaba aine omutabani muto orikwetwa Miika; ab'omu ka ya Ziiba boona bakaba bari abairu ba Mefiboshesi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atyo Mefiboshesi yaaguma Yerusaalemu, ahakuba akaba ariira aha meeza y'omugabe obutoosha; kandi akaba aremaire ebigyere byombi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.9.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
